cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "UpliftBench: causal uplift-modeling benchmark on Criteo Uplift v2"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark of five uplift estimators (S-learner, T-learner,
  X-learner, DR-learner, LinearDML) on the Criteo Uplift Prediction Dataset v2,
  with Qini and AUUC evaluation, four-way customer segmentation, DoWhy
  refutation, and a Streamlit budget explorer.
type: software
authors:
